      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "CAQ8_01",
          "content": "即使有时没能达成目标，我仍然能坚持自己的目标。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "caq_truth_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAQ8_02",
          "content": "当目标难以达成时，我能一步一步小步前进。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "caq_truth_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAQ8_03",
          "content": "我更愿意换一种方法去接近目标，而不是放弃。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "caq_truth_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAQ8_04",
          "content": "即使进展缓慢，我也能坚持执行自己的长期计划。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "caq_truth_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAQ8_05",
          "content": "除非感到事情是成功的，否则我很难把一件事继续做下去。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "caq_truth_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAQ8_06",
          "content": "当我感到痛苦或泄气时，我会让自己的承诺松懈下来。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "caq_truth_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAQ8_07",
          "content": "我会陷在自己的想法或情绪里，以至于做不了对我重要的事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "caq_truth_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAQ8_08",
          "content": "如果不能按自己的方式做一件事，我就干脆不做。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "caq_truth_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
      ],
